---
layout: base
title: Publications
description: "Publications by Mert Biricik: two IEEE UPEC 2025 papers on power distribution security, and manuscripts under review on cognitive screening and the brainrot literature."
priority: 0.8
changefreq: monthly
---

{% set published = 0 %}{% set inReview = 0 %}
{% for p in publications %}{% if p.status == 'published' %}{% set published = published + 1 %}{% elif p.status == 'under-review' or p.status == 'submitted' %}{% set inReview = inReview + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}

<section class="container-wide pt-20 pb-12 md:pt-28">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <p class="meta-label mb-6">Publications</p>
      <h1 class="display-2 mb-8">Papers and manuscripts</h1>
      <p class="font-sans text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Two conference papers on the security of power distribution systems, and two manuscripts under review on cognitive screening tests and the brainrot literature.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6">
        <a href="{{ metadata.social.scholar }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-sans text-sm font-medium text-primary-600 hover:underline">Google Scholar profile</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="lg:col-span-4">
      <div class="clean-card grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-center">
        <div>
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-slate-900">{{ publications | length }}</p>
          <p class="label mt-1">Total</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-slate-900">{{ published }}</p>
          <p class="label mt-1">Published</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-slate-900">{{ inReview }}</p>
          <p class="label mt-1">In review</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container-wide pb-24">
  <ol class="grid gap-6">
    {% for pub in publications %}
    <li>
      <article class="clean-card flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start group hover:border-primary-200">
        <div class="shrink-0 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-slate-300 group-hover:text-primary-500 transition-colors">{{ pub.year }}</div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            {% set status = pub.status %}{% include "status.njk" %}
            <span class="font-sans font-medium text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">{{ pub.venue }}</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors leading-snug">
            {% if pub.link %}<a href="{{ pub.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">{{ pub.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ pub.title }}{% endif %}
          </h2>
          <p class="font-sans text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 mb-3">{{ pub.authors | join(', ') }}</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">{{ pub.summary }}</p>
          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
            {% for t in pub.tags %}<span class="tag">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}
            {% if pub.doi %}<a href="{{ pub.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="tag hover:text-primary-600 font-mono break-all">doi:{{ pub.doi }}</a>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="bg-white border-y border-slate-200 py-20">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-12 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6">
      <h2 class="display-3">Research areas</h2>
      <p class="meta-label">What the papers are about</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="clean-card">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary-600 tracking-wider">01</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3 mb-3">Critical infrastructure security</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">OSINT assessments of SCADA systems and anomaly detection for non-technical losses in power distribution networks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="clean-card">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary-600 tracking-wider">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3 mb-3">Cognitive assessment</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">How screening tests like the MMSE and the MoCA perform at their conventional cut-offs, and what the "brainrot" literature actually contains.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="clean-card">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-primary-600 tracking-wider">03</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3 mb-3">EEG and brain–computer interfaces</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Signal processing for EEG-based BCIs in the BCI-Feast lab at Kadir Has University.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container-wide section text-center">
  <h2 class="display-3 mb-4">Want to work together?</h2>
  <p class="font-sans text-lg text-slate-500 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">I'm interested in joint work on applied cybersecurity and anomaly detection.</p>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Contact</a>
    <a href="/projects/" class="btn-secondary">Projects</a>
  </div>
</section>
